    - target: {fileID: 4959500203299594544, guid: 21a46dfea5bdae243bc5093848184b2a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '<color=orange>DATA:</color>

        Initially designed as an augmentation
        to ease the work of humans working as loaders, this arm is capable of launching
        the bearer with great force.


        <color=orange>STRATEGY:</color>

        -
        After launching yourself, the arm will be disabled. It can be reenabled by
        touching the ground, killing an enemy with it, or hitting a coin. If you
        hit an enemy without killing it, you will recieve hard damage.


        -
        On collision with coins, they will ricochet as if they were punched with
        the Feedbacker.


        - Collision damage is equal to 7.5% of the magnitude
        of your velocity. Doing a dash-jump before firing is recommended.


        -
        The arm charges at a rate of 60% per second for the first 66.6%, then at
        a rate of 45% per second for the last 33.3%.


        - While riding a rocket,
        it will be launched, rather than you. Its speed will increase dramatically,
        and it will turn to where you are looking.


        -Hitting the floor with
        enough speed from an Earthshatter dash creates a shockwave, which is bigger
        with velocity.




'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4978821778061534487, guid: 21a46dfea5bdae243bc5093848184b2a,
