    - target: {fileID: 6855963822826908850, guid: 21a46dfea5bdae243bc5093848184b2a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '<color=orange>DATA:</color>

        Each strike with this weapon embeds
        a conductive shard into the victim, attracting lightning.


        <color=orange>STRATEGY:</color>

        -
        Each third swing of the oar will <color=orange>EXPOSE</color> enemies, causing
        the next hit to explode.


        - The thrown oar can be parried with the
        <color=orange>FEEDBACKER</color>, causing it to gain speed and damage.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
