    - target: {fileID: 4959500203299594544, guid: 21a46dfea5bdae243bc5093848184b2a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '<color=orange>DATA:</color>

        Through the use of the cores of
        slain Virtues, the machines of Hell were able to make the Railcannon fire
        holy light.


        <color=orange>STRATEGY:</color>

        - While the
        individual virtue beams are not very powerful, damage can quickly add up
        when multiple enemies in close proximity each spawn their own beams.


        -
        Both shooting enemies, and shooting the environment, will spawn a beam, but
        ones spawned on enemies are larger, stronger, and take less time to activate.


        -
        Beams can boost you, making this weapon useful for mobility.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
