        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_SizeDelta.y
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6840613696959850645, guid: 21a46dfea5bdae243bc5093848184b2a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: E.P. CHARGER
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6855963822826908850, guid: 21a46dfea5bdae243bc5093848184b2a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "<color=orange>DATA:</color>\nUnlike other rocket launchers, this weapon
        uses the energy from an unstable, experimental plasma, hence the name E.P.
        While this has the advantage of being able to detonate multiple times, it
        must be charged with the chemical reactions of other rockets.\n\n<color=orange>STRATEGY:</color>\n-
        E.P. rockets have are larger, have larger explosions, and deal more damage,
        based on charge.\n\n- Although costly, E.P. rockets are very powerful. As
        they are not destroyed until they hit the environment, a skilled user could
        obtain several of these homing rockets at once.\n\n- The process of charging
        the rockets can be made faster with airshots - where normal shots only charge
        the gauge by one, airshots charge it by two.\n\n- Revolvers with fast fire
        rates, such as the <color=orange>FAN FIRE</color> or <color=orange>MALEVOLENT</color>,
        are especially useful, as they will cause several detonations in a short
        space of time.\n\n- As they home to where you are looking, E.P. rockets will
        be more effective in open areas, where they are easier to direct without
        hitting a wall.\n\n- It is easier to direct a E.P. rocket when you are riding
        it, as it will go where you are looking. However, the explosions will still
        be able to harm you.\n\n- When used alongside the <color=orange>CONDUCTOR</color>
        nailgun, E.P. rockets are extremely powerful, as the many explosions will
        now stun enemies. The increased speed and homing also make this combo useful
        for fast yet precise movement. \n\n\n<size=8><i>and why he eepy?</i></size>\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7170365296153474310, guid: 21a46dfea5bdae243bc5093848184b2a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: weaponName
      value: rock4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7682565424674736954, guid: 21a46dfea5bdae243bc5093848184b2a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
