    - target: {fileID: 1280303766337146166, guid: 21a46dfea5bdae243bc5093848184b2a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Sprite
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d9f69b8b98ba5b0458604d324cdd9c99,
        type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 1588891100038535674, guid: 21a46dfea5bdae243bc5093848184b2a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: variationNumber
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2326829199046549010, guid: 21a46dfea5bdae243bc5093848184b2a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '<color=orange>DATA:</color>

        This weapon does extremely intensive
        calculations to find the best time to fire, at which the beam will bounce
        off targets. It requires a cooldown, so that it does not overheat.


        <color=orange>STRATEGY:</color>

        -
        When the revolver is shot and the bar is on the sweet-spot, the beam will
        bounce between enemies. Each time the beam bounces, it does less damage.


        -
        The default weapon has a larger sweetspot, which only shrinks a small amount,
        and the bar gains speed at a low rate, However, the beam does less damage,
        and only bounces twice.


        - The alternate weapon has a smaller sweetspot,
        which shrinks faster, and the bar gains speed at a high rate. However, the
        beam does more damage, and bounces five times.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2414340598935673397, guid: 21a46dfea5bdae243bc5093848184b2a,
