    - target: {fileID: 4959500203299594544, guid: 21a46dfea5bdae243bc5093848184b2a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '<color=orange>DATA:</color>

        Similar to the <color=orange>MALICIOUS</color>
        railcannon, this weapon uses hell energy to create explosions, only at a
        smaller scale.


        <color=orange>STRATEGY:</color>

        - The primary
        fire''s three shot burst deals more damage, but requires greater accuracy
        to hit all the shots.


        - The beam is similar to the <color=orange>MALICIOUS</color>
        one, and will cause a large explosion when shot at a core or rocket.


        -
        Due to its smaller damage, this weapon can be used for movement, if the user
        shoots it at their feet.


        -The standard version does not pierce,
        but has a large, strong explosion.


        - The alternate version has
        a weaker explosion, but can pierce enemies, and hit them several times.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
