      propertyPath: m_Size
      value: 0.3592968
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4959500203299594544, guid: 21a46dfea5bdae243bc5093848184b2a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '<color=orange>DATA:</color>

        Through reverse-engineering the
        functions of the Mindflayer, its beam was able to be recreated, using the
        heat of the nailgun rather than hell energy.


        <color=orange>STRATEGY:</color>

        -
        The nailgun''s beam has a high damage output, especially when combined with
        coins. However, the beam needs constant contact, which can be hard to maintain
        on fast-moving enemies.


        - The sawblade launcher''s homing projectiles
        deal high amounts of damage, but must be directed with accuracy, as they
        will be destroyed if they hit a wall.


        - Any type of nailgun or
        sawblade launcher will charge the gauge, although sawblade launchers are
        more effective, due to their higher hitrate.


        - The alt fires for
        both the nailgun and sawblade launcher will recoil the user, sending them
        backwards. This can be useful for evading attacks in a pinch.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
