    - target: {fileID: 1834975023130164172, guid: 21a46dfea5bdae243bc5093848184b2a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: weaponName
      value: sho3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2326829199046549010, guid: 21a46dfea5bdae243bc5093848184b2a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '<color=orange>DATA:</color>

        Similarly to the corpse of Minos,
        this weapon summons a powerful black hole.


        <color=orange>STRATEGY:</color>

        -
        The gun charges with blood. You need 400 HP worth of blood to fill the gauge.


        -
        Although it is slow, the singularity is extremely powerful, dealing large
        amounts of damage on contact.


        - The lifespan of the singularity
        is ten seconds. Parrying it redirects it, makes it implode, and increases
        it''s life by one second.


        - Shooting it with a hitscan beam causes
        it to implode, sucking in all nearby enemies and projectiles. Coins will
        hit it as well. Implosions are larger with stronger beams.


        - Magnets,
        cores, rockets, and other projectiles like sticky mines and those fired by
        enemies, will all be trapped by the singularity. They will continue to function
        as they usually do.


        - When a screwdriver drill is in the singularity,
        it will cause an implosion every 0.75 seconds.


        - At the end of
        the singularity''s life, everything inside of it will explode.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2414340598935673397, guid: 21a46dfea5bdae243bc5093848184b2a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: SINGULARITY
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
