    - target: {fileID: 6855963822826908850, guid: 21a46dfea5bdae243bc5093848184b2a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '<color=orange>DATA:</color>

        Originally used by humans to destroy
        sentries in war, this weapon is effective at creating traps and dealing large
        amounts of damage at once.


        <color=orange>STRATEGY:</color>

        -
        The mines will detonate when any enemy, or explosions, collide with them.


        -
        They can be parried, dealing large amounts of damage to many enemies from
        a distance.


        - They can be detonated at any time by holding Alt
        Fire, then releasing. This can be done mid air for mobility.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7170365296153474310, guid: 21a46dfea5bdae243bc5093848184b2a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: weaponName
      value: sho4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
